
### Get appointments summary for a given day
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/summary?businessId=1&date=2026-11-16

### Get all appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments


### Get appointments by business
### Studio Armonia (assuming businessId = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?businessId=1


### Get appointments by client
### First seeded client (assuming clientId = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?clientId=1


### Get appointments by service
### First service of Studio Armonia (assuming serviceId = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?serviceId=1


### Get confirmed appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?status=CONFIRMED


### Get cancelled appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?status=CANCELLED


### Get appointments by date
### Next Monday: 2026-11-16
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?startDate=2026-11-16&endDate=2026-11-16


### Get appointments by business and date
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?businessId=1&startDate=2026-11-16&endDate=2026-11-16


### Get confirmed appointments by business
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?businessId=1&status=CONFIRMED


### Get appointments by business and client
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?businessId=1&clientId=1


### Get appointments by service and status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?serviceId=1&status=CONFIRMED


### Get appointments with all filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?businessId=1&clientId=1&serviceId=1&status=CONFIRMED&startDate=2026-11-16&endDate=2026-11-16

### Create appointment (registered client)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "clientId": 1,
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "paymentMethod": "PHYSICAL",
  "clientNote": "Created via API"
}

### Create appointment (guest client)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "businessId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "employeeId": 1,
  "clientName": "George Vasile",
  "clientEmail": "george.vasile@example.com",
  "clientPhone": "0744112233",
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "startTime": "14:00:00",
  "paymentMethod": "PHYSICAL",
  "clientNote": "Guest booking"
}
